{
  "name": "connect-ai-slides-web",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "One story, a presentation deck and a one-page website. 67 motion blocks from GSAP, Motion, anime.js, Lottie, CSS, HyperFrames and Remotion go through one seekable block contract, and a check measures the real screen (type size, contrast, words, motion, phone width, nothing on a face or body, eyes open on people's posters).",
